### Starting Conditions

- **Record 1010**: `G.Arthur_Muddy == 2`
- **Record 1011**: `G.Arthur_Talked > 0`

**Analysis**: The actual quest starts when player has `G.Arthur_Talked > 0` (verified by Record 1011)

